      <div class="v-rune">✦</div>
      <h2>IT IS DONE.</h2>
      <p>"The abyss has swallowed you whole."</p>
      <button id="restart-btn">HUNT AGAIN</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<footer>May your dice roll true &nbsp;✦&nbsp; The story continues</footer>

